  "ruleText": "Env-A 4609.08 Notification of Certification Testing and Retesting. The CO2 AAR shall submit written notices of certification testing and retesting in accordance with 40 CFR 75.61 to the department, the appropriate EPA Regional Office, and the Administrator.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20",
